3.3 of the NVIDIA License, those files (and any derivative works, model
checkpoints, or outputs) may be used non-commercially only (for research or
evaluation purposes). The core Quanteeze inference server never imports
src/quanteeze/vendor/nemotron_image/; it is lazily loaded only when the
optional image generation tool (quanteeze.nemotron_image / quanteeze.image_mcp)
is invoked. Recipients redistributing or using Quanteeze under GPL-2.0-only or
for commercial purposes must omit src/quanteeze/vendor/nemotron_image/ (and
not use the optional Nemotron-Labs-Image integration); the rest of Quanteeze
is unaffected. No model weights are distributed in this repository.

